ondary\">Eveniment privat</span>\n</p></div>"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "even002", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Aniversări, cumetrii, onomastici: muzica pentru o petrecere de familie", "header_size": "h1", "title_color": "#E5E2E1", "__globals__": {"title_color": "globals/colors?id=primary", "typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=primary"}, "_margin": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "20", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "_margin_tablet": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "20", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "_margin_mobile": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "20", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "_element_id": "hero-titlu"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "even003", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>La o petrecere de familie nu există un program pe care să-l știe toată lumea dinainte. O aniversare rotundă, o cumetrie sau o zi onomastică poate fi o cină cu muzică de ascultare, o petrecere până dimineața sau amândouă, pe rând. Seara o hotărăște gazda, iar muzica se potrivește pe ce a hotărât ea.</p>", "text_color": "#C6C6C6", "custom_css": "selector p{margin:0}selector{max-width:672px}", "__globals__": {"text_color": "globals/colors?id=secondary", "typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=quote"}, "_margin": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "32", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "_margin_tablet": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "32", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "_margin_mobile": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "32", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}}, "elements": []}, {"id": "even004", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "html", "settings": {"html": "<div class=\"ib-tw\"><div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4\">\n<a class=\"inline-block text-center whitespace-nowrap bg-accent text-white px-8 md:px-10 py-4 uppercase font-label-md text-label-md tracking-widest hover:bg-accent-hover transition-colors w-full sm:w-auto\" href=\"https://wa.me/40722911485?text=Bun%C4%83%20ziua%21%20Organizez%20o%20petrecere%20de%20familie%20%C8%99i%20a%C8%99%20dori%20s%C4%83%20discut%C4%83m%20muzica.\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Întreabă pe WhatsApp</a>\n<a class=\"btn-secundar-zona inline-block text-center whitespace-nowrap text-on-surface bg-transparent px-8 md:px-10 py-4 uppercase font-label-md text-label-md tracking-widest hover:bg-white/5 transition-colors w-full sm:w-auto\" href=\"tel:+40722911485\">+40 722 911 485</a>\n</div></div>"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "even005", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p><span class=\"ph\">Imagine provizorie — se înlocuiește cu fotografie de scenă într-un salon mic sau la o petrecere restrânsă (peisaj, min. 1440 px lățime)</span></p>", "text_color": "#C6C6C6", "custom_css": "selector p{margin:0}", "__globals__": {"text_color": "globals/colors?id=secondary", "typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=text"}, "_margin": {"unit": "px", "top": "24", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "_margin_tablet": {"unit": "px", "top": "24", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "_margin_mobile": {"unit": "px", "top": "24", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}}, "elements": []}, {"id": "even006", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "html", "settings": {"html": "<div class=\"ib-tw\"><div class=\"motif-separator w-24 md:w-36 mt-10\"></div></div>"}, "elements": []}], "isInner": true}], "isInner": false}, {"id": "even00f", "elType": "container", "settings": {"container_type": "flex", "content_width": "boxed", "boxed_width": {"unit": "px", "size": 1072, "sizes": []}, "flex_direction": "column", "flex_gap": {"unit": "px", "size": 0, "column": "0", "row": "0", "isLinked": true}, "background_background": "classic", "background_color": "#131313", "__globals__": {"background_color": "globals/colors?id=surface"}, "custom_css": "selector{background-color:#131313}", "padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "80", "right": "64", "bottom": "80", "left": "64", "isLinked": false}, "padding_tablet": {"unit": "px", "top": "80", "right": "64", "bottom": "80", "left": "64", "isLinked": false}, "padding_mobile": {"unit": "px", "top": "48", "right": "24", "bottom": "48", "left": "24", "isLinked": false}}, "elements": [{"id": "even00e", "elType": "container", "settings": {"container_type": "flex", "content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "flex_gap": {"unit": "px", "size": 0, "column": "0", "row": "0", "isLinked": true}, "width": {"unit": "px", "size": 768, "sizes": []}, "width_mobile": {"unit": "%", "size": 100, "sizes": []}, "_margin": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "custom_css": "selector{max-width:100%}"}, "elements": [{"id": "even009", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Proces", "header_size": "div", "title_color": "#C6C6C6", "typography_typography": "custom", "typography_font_family": "Inter", "typography_font_size": {"unit": "px", "size": 14, "sizes": []}, "typography_font_weight": "600", "typography_text_transform": "uppercase", "typography_letter_spacing": {"unit": "em", "size": 0.2, "sizes": []}, "typography_line_height": {"unit": "px", "size": 20, "sizes": []}, "__globals__": {"title_color": "globals/colors?id=secondary"}, "_margin": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "16", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "_margin_tablet": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "16", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "_margin_mobile": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "16", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}}, "elements": []}, {"id": "even00a", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Gazda decide forma serii", "header_size": "h2", "title_color": "#E5E2E1", "__globals__": {"title_color": "globals/colors?id=primary", "typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=secondary"}, "_margin": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "24", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "_margin_tablet": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "24", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "_margin_mobile": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "24", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "_element_id": "proces-titlu"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "even00b", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>O nuntă și un botez au momente fixe, cunoscute de toți invitații. O aniversare are, de regulă, unul singur — tortul — și, uneori, un toast. Restul serii e al gazdei. De aici pornește orice discuție despre muzica unui eveniment privat: cât din seară e masă, cât e ring și în ce ordine.</p>", "text_color": "#C6C6C6", "custom_css": "selector p{margin:0}", "__globals__": {"text_color": "globals/colors?id=secondary", "typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=quote"}, "_margin": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}}, "elements": []}, {"id": "even00c", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Configurația urmează răspunsul. Pentru o seară în care muzica stă mai mult în fundal ajunge o formație mică, sprijinită de DJ; pentru o petrecere lungă, cu jocuri, contează ca programul live să fie împărțit pe toată durata ei, nu concentrat la început. Pachetele publicate sunt pentru nuntă și botez, deci pentru un eveniment privat componența și tariful se stabilesc pe fiecare caz: <span class=\"ph\">[CONFIGURAȚIE ȘI TARIF PENTRU EVENIMENT PRIVAT — de confirmat]</span>.</p>", "text_color": "#C6C6C6", "custom_css": "selector p{margin:0}", "__globals__": {"text_color": "globals/colors?id=secondary", "typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=quote"}, "_margin": {"unit": "px", "top": "24", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "_margin_tablet": {"unit": "px", "top": "24", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "_margin_mobile": {"unit": "px", "top": "24", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}}, "elements": []}, {"id": "even00d", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Cumetria e un caz aparte. În unele regiuni așa se numește masa de după botez, deci are tipicul botezului, cu nașii în rolul principal; pentru ea, pagina de botez e ghidul potrivit. Onomastica și aniversarea sunt mai libere și se construiesc aproape în întregime pe preferințele sărbătoritului.</p>", "text_color": "#C6C6C6", "custom_css": "selector p{margin:0}", "__globals__": {"text_color": "globals/colors?id=secondary", "typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=quote"}, "_margin": {"unit": "px", "top": "24", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "_margin_tablet": {"unit": "px", "top": "24", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "_margin_mobile": {"unit": "px", "top": "24", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}}, "elements": []}], "isInner": true}], "isInner": false}, {"id": "even011", "elType": "container", "settings": {"container_type": "flex", "content_width": "boxed", "boxed_width": {"unit": "px", "size": 1072, "sizes": []}, "flex_direction": "column", "flex_gap": {"unit": "px", "size": 0, "column": "0", "row": "0", "isLinked": true}, "background_background": "classic", "background_color": "#131313", "__globals__": {"background_color": "globals/colors?id=surface"}, "custom_css": "selector{background-color:#131313}", "padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "64", "bottom": "0", "left": "64", "isLinked": false}, "padding_tablet": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "64", "bottom": "0", "left": "64", "isLinked": false}, "padding_mobile": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "24", "bottom": "0", "left": "24", "isLinked": false}}, "elements": [{"id": "even010", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "html", "settings": {"html": "<div class=\"zona-divider\"></div>"}, "elements": []}], "isInner": false}, {"id": "even013", "elType": "container", "settings": {"container_type": "flex", "content_width": "boxed", "boxed_width": {"unit": "px", "size": 1072, "sizes": []}, "flex_direction": "column", "flex_gap": {"unit": "px", "size": 0, "column": "0", "row": "0", "isLinked": true}, "background_background": "classic", "background_color": "#131313", "__globals__": {"background_color": "globals/colors?id=surface"}, "custom_css": "selector{background-color:#131313}", "padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "80", "right": "64", "bottom": "80", "left": "64", "isLinked": false}, "padding_tablet": {"unit": "px", "top": "80", "right": "64", "bottom": "80", "left": "64", "isLinked": false}, "padding_mobile": {"unit": "px", "top": "48", "right": "24", "bottom": "48", "left": "24", "isLinked": false}}, "elements": [{"id": "even012", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "html", "settings": {"html": "<div class=\"ib-tw\"><div class=\"max-w-3xl\">\n<span class=\"font-label-md text-label-md text-primary uppercase tracking-[0.2em] block mb-4\">Repere</span>\n<h2 class=\"font-headline-lg text-2xl md:text-headline-lg leading-tight mb-6\" id=\"momente-titlu\">Momentele care revin la cele mai multe petreceri de familie</h2>\n<p class=\"font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant mb-10\">Nu sunt obligatorii și nu vin neapărat în ordinea asta. Sunt reperele pe care se sprijină programul, iar gazda păstrează ce i se potrivește.</p>\n<ol class=\"flex flex-col gap-8 md:gap-10\">\n<li class=\"flex gap-5 md:gap-8\">\n<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"font-display-lg text-3xl md:text-4xl text-on-surface-variant leading-none shrink-0 w-10 md:w-12\">01</span>\n<div>\n<h3 class=\"font-headline-md text-lg md:text-headline-md text-on-surface leading-snug mb-3\">Sosirea</h3>\n<p class=\"font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant\">Muzică de fundal cât se strâng invitații. La un eveniment restrâns, primele minute stabilesc tonul: o seară de salon începe altfel decât o petrecere.</p>\n</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"flex gap-5 md:gap-8\">\n<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"font-display-lg text-3xl md:text-4xl text-on-surface-variant leading-none shrink-0 w-10 md:w-12\">02</span>\n<div>\n<h3 class=\"font-headline-md text-lg md:text-headline-md text-on-surface leading-snug mb-3\">Toastul sau discursul</h3>\n<p class=\"font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant\">Convenim cu gazda, la discuția de organizare, dacă muzica se oprește de tot sau doar coboară sub voce. Cine vorbește are nevoie de un microfon și de un fond liniștit, iar reluarea programului se face după ultimul cuvânt, nu la mijlocul lui.</p>\n</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"flex gap-5 md:gap-8\">\n<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"font-display-lg text-3xl md:text-4xl text-on-surface-variant leading-none shrink-0 w-10 md:w-12\">03</span>\n<div>\n<h3 class=\"font-headline-md text-lg md:text-headline-md text-on-surface leading-snug mb-3\">Masa</h3>\n<p class=\"font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant\">Muzică de ascultare: cântec ușor, romanțe, melodii de masă din folclor. Când în sală sunt mulți invitați din generația sărbătoritului, e partea serii la care repertoriul merită gândit cu cea mai mare grijă.</p>\n</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"flex gap-5 md:gap-8\">\n<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"font-display-lg text-3xl md:text-4xl text-on-surface-variant leading-none shrink-0 w-10 md:w-12\">04</span>\n<div>\n<h3 class=\"font-headline-md text-lg md:text-headline-md text-on-surface leading-snug mb-3\">Piesa sărbătoritului</h3>\n<p class=\"font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant\">O melodie aleasă de familie pentru sărbătorit, cântată live dacă există aranjament sau pusă de DJ. Se hotărăște dinainte, ca să nu fie improvizată pe loc.</p>\n</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"flex gap-5 md:gap-8\">\n<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"font-display-lg text-3xl md:text-4xl text-on-surface-variant leading-none shrink-0 w-10 md:w-12\">05</span>\n<div>\n<h3 class=\"font-headline-md text-lg md:text-headline-md text-on-surface leading-snug mb-3\">Tortul</h3>\n<p class=\"font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant\">Singurul moment fix al unei aniversări sau al unei onomastici. Ora lui se stabilește cu localul, iar muzica se aliniază la ea.</p>\n</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"flex gap-5 md:gap-8\">\n<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"font-display-lg text-3xl md:text-4xl text-on-surface-variant leading-none shrink-0 w-10 md:w-12\">06</span>\n<div>\n<h3 class=\"font-headline-md text-lg md:text-headline-md text-on-surface leading-snug mb-3\">Petrecerea</h3>\n<p class=\"font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant\">Dacă gazda o vrea: hore, sârbe, muzică de petrecere — cu manele, dacă le cere, așezate cum explică pagina despre <a class=\"text-primary underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-white transition-colors\" href=\"/folclor-si-manele/\">folclor și manele</a> —, apoi DJ. Durata ei e greu de prevăzut, motiv pentru care programul flexibil contează mai mult aici decât la orice alt tip de eveniment.</p>\n</div>\n</li>\n</ol>\n</div></div>"}, "elements": []}], "isInner": false}, {"id": "even015", "elType": "container", "settings": {"container_type": "flex", "content_width": "boxed", "boxed_width": {"unit": "px", "size": 1072, "sizes": []}, "flex_direction": "column", "flex_gap": {"unit": "px", "size": 0, "column": "0", "row": "0", "isLinked": true}, "background_background": "classic", "background_color": "#131313", "__globals__": {"background_color": "globals/colors?id=surface"}, "custom_css": "selector{background-color:#131313}", "padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "64", "bottom": "0", "left": "64", "isLinked": false}, "padding_tablet": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "64", "bottom": "0", "left": "64", "isLinked": false}, "padding_mobile": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "24", "bottom": "0", "left": "24", "isLinked": false}}, "elements": [{"id": "even014", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "html", "settings": {"html": "<div class=\"zona-divider\"></div>"}, "elements": []}], "isInner": false}, {"id": "even01b", "elType": "container", "settings": {"container_type": "flex", "content_width": "boxed", "boxed_width": {"unit": "px", "size": 1072, "sizes": []}, "flex_direction": "column", "flex_gap": {"unit": "px", "size": 0, "column": "0", "row": "0", "isLinked": true}, "background_background": "classic", "background_color": "#131313", "__globals__": {"background_color": "globals/colors?id=surface"}, "custom_css": "selector{background-color:#131313}", "padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "80", "right": "64", "bottom": "80", "left": "64", "isLinked": false}, "padding_tablet": {"unit": "px", "top": "80", "right": "64", "bottom": "80", "left": "64", "isLinked": false}, "padding_mobile": {"unit": "px", "top": "48", "right": "24", "bottom": "48", "left": "24", "isLinked": false}}, "elements": [{"id": "even019", "elType": "container", "settings": {"container_type": "flex", "content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "flex_gap": {"unit": "px", "size": 0, "column": "0", "row": "0", "isLinked": true}, "width": {"unit": "px", "size": 768, "sizes": []}, "width_mobile": {"unit": "%", "size": 100, "sizes": []}, "_margin": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "48", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "_margin_tablet": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "48", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "_margin_mobile": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "32", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "custom_css": "selector{max-width:100%}"}, "elements": [{"id": "even016", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Decizii", "header_size": "div", "title_color": "#C6C6C6", "typography_typography": "custom", "typography_font_family": "Inter", "typography_font_size": {"unit": "px", "size": 14, "sizes": []}, "typography_font_weight": "600", "typography_text_transform": "uppercase", "typography_letter_spacing": {"unit": "em", "size": 0.2, "sizes": []}, "typography_line_height": {"unit": "px", "size": 20, "sizes": []}, "__globals__": {"title_color": "globals/colors?id=secondary"}, "_margin": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "16", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "_margin_tablet": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "16", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "_margin_mobile": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "16", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}}, "elements": []}, {"id": "even017", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Ce stabiliți înainte de petrecere", "header_size": "h2", "title_color": "#E5E2E1", "__globals__": {"title_color": "globals/colors?id=primary", "typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=secondary"}, "_margin": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "16", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "_margin_tablet": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "16", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "_margin_mobile": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "16", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "_element_id": "decizii-titlu"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "even018", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Patru hotărâri, fiecare cu pagina ei. La un eveniment privat, prima dintre ele le schimbă pe toate celelalte.</p>", "text_color": "#C6C6C6", "custom_css": "selector p{margin:0}", "__globals__": {"text_color": "globals/colors?id=secondary", "typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=text"}, "_margin": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}}, "elements": []}], "isInner": true}, {"id": "even01a", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "html", "settings": {"html": "<div class=\"ib-tw\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 md:gap-gutter max-w-5xl\">\n<article class=\"glass-card silver-border p-6 md:p-8 flex flex-col gap-3\">\n<span class=\"font-label-md text-[11px] uppercase tracking-widest text-on-surface-variant\">Înainte de orice</span>\n<h3 class=\"font-headline-md text-xl md:text-headline-md leading-snug\">Cât buget pentru muzică</h3>\n<p class=\"font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant\">Grila de pe site acoperă doar nunțile și botezurile. Pentru o petrecere de familie pachetele de acolo sunt un reper de configurație și de ordin de mărime, util înainte de prima discuție, nu oferta finală.</p>\n<p class=\"mt-auto pt-2\"><a class=\"font-label-md text-label-md uppercase tracking-widest text-primary hover:text-white transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-2 min-h-[44px]\" href=\"/oferte/\">Vezi grila de pachete <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"text-[18px]\" fill=\"currentColor\" height=\"1em\" style=\"vertical-align:-.125em\" viewbox=\"0 -960 960 960\" width=\"1em\"><path d=\"M693.69-457.31H180v-45.38h513.69L448.39-748 480-780l300 300-300 300-31.61-32 245.3-245.31Z\"></path></svg></a></p>\n</article>\n<article class=\"glass-card silver-border p-6 md:p-8 flex flex-col gap-3\">\n<span class=\"font-label-md text-[11px] uppercase tracking-widest text-on-surface-variant\">După lista de invitați</span>\n<h3 class=\"font-headline-md text-xl md:text-headline-md leading-snug\">Ce generații sunt în sală</h3>\n<p class=\"font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant\">O aniversare de 60 de ani și una de 30 nu se cântă la fel. Din ce zonă e familia și ce vârste predomină decid proporția dintre folclor și muzica ușoară; pagina de repertoriu descrie jocurile fiecărei regiuni.</p>\n<p class=\"mt-auto pt-2\"><a class=\"font-label-md text-label-md uppercase tracking-widest text-primary hover:text-white transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-2 min-h-[44px]\" href=\"/repertoriu/\">Alege repertoriul pe zone <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"text-[18px]\" fill=\"currentColor\" height=\"1em\" style=\"vertical-align:-.125em\" viewbox=\"0 -960 960 960\" width=\"1em\"><path d=\"M693.69-457.31H180v-45.38h513.69L448.39-748 480-780l300 300-300 300-31.61-32 245.3-245.31Z\"></path></svg></a></p>\n</article>\n<article class=\"glass-card silver-border p-6 md:p-8 flex flex-col gap-3\">\n<span class=\"font-label-md text-[11px] uppercase tracking-widest text-on-surface-variant\">Cu localul ales</span>\n<h3 class=\"font-headline-md text-xl md:text-headline-md leading-snug\">Cât de mare poate fi formația</h3>\n<p class=\"font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant\">Un salon privat, o terasă sau o curte nu primesc aceeași scenă. Spațiul disponibil și accesul la curent spun câți muzicieni încap; rolul fiecărui instrument e pe pagina formației.</p>\n<p class=\"mt-auto pt-2\"><a class=\"font-label-md text-label-md uppercase tracking-widest text-primary hover:text-white transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-2 min-h-[44px]\" href=\"/formatia/\">Vezi componența și producția <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"text-[18px]\" fill=\"currentColor\" height=\"1em\" style=\"vertical-align:-.125em\" viewbox=\"0 -960 960 960\" width=\"1em\"><path d=\"M693.69-457.31H180v-45.38h513.69L448.39-748 480-780l300 300-300 300-31.61-32 245.3-245.31Z\"></path></svg></a></p>\n</article>\n<article class=\"glass-card silver-border p-6 md:p-8 flex flex-col gap-3\">\n<span class=\"font-label-md text-[11px] uppercase tracking-widest text-on-surface-variant\">Dacă petrecerea e în afara orașului</span>\n<h3 class=\"font-headline-md text-xl md:text-headline-md leading-snug\">Ce adaugă drumul</h3>\n<p class=\"font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant\">Unele petreceri de familie se țin la o pensiune sau la casa de la țară. Drumul până acolo intră în preț, iar de la o anumită distanță intră și nopțile de cazare ale echipei; calculul, pe județe, e pe pagina de zone.</p>\n<p class=\"mt-auto pt-2\"><a class=\"font-label-md text-label-md uppercase tracking-widest text-primary hover:text-white transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-2 min-h-[44px]\" href=\"/zone/\">Vezi zonele deservite <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"text-[18px]\" fill=\"currentColor\" height=\"1em\" style=\"vertical-align:-.125em\" viewbox=\"0 -960 960 960\" width=\"1em\"><path d=\"M693.69-457.31H180v-45.38h513.69L448.39-748 480-780l300 300-300 300-31.61-32 245.3-245.31Z\"></path></svg></a></p>\n</article>\n</div></div>"}, "elements": []}], "isInner": false}, {"id": "even01d", "elType": "container", "settings": {"container_type": "flex", "content_width": "boxed", "boxed_width": {"unit": "px", "size": 1072, "sizes": []}, "flex_direction": "column", "flex_gap": {"unit": "px", "size": 0, "column": "0", "row": "0", "isLinked": true}, "background_background": "classic", "background_color": "#131313", "__globals__": {"background_color": "globals/colors?id=surface"}, "custom_css": "selector{background-color:#131313}", "padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "64", "bottom": "0", "left": "64", "isLinked": false}, "padding_tablet": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "64", "bottom": "0", "left": "64", "isLinked": false}, "padding_mobile": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "24", "bottom": "0", "left": "24", "isLinked": false}}, "elements": [{"id": "even01c", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "html", "settings": {"html": "<div class=\"zona-divider\"></div>"}, "elements": []}], "isInner": false}, {"id": "even01f", "elType": "container", "settings": {"container_type": "flex", "content_width": "boxed", "boxed_width": {"unit": "px", "size": 1072, "sizes": []}, "flex_direction": "column", "flex_gap": {"unit": "px", "size": 0, "column": "0", "row": "0", "isLinked": true}, "background_background": "classic", "background_color": "#131313", "__globals__": {"background_color": "globals/colors?id=surface"}, "custom_css": "selector{background-color:#131313}", "padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "80", "right": "64", "bottom": "80", "left": "64", "isLinked": false}, "padding_tablet": {"unit": "px", "top": "80", "right": "64", "bottom": "80", "left": "64", "isLinked": false}, "padding_mobile": {"unit": "px", "top": "48", "right": "24", "bottom": "48", "left": "24", "isLinked": false}}, "elements": [{"id": "even01e", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "html", "settings": {"html": "<div class=\"ib-tw\"><div class=\"max-w-4xl\">\n<span class=\"font-label-md text-label-md text-primary uppercase tracking-[0.2em] block mb-4\">Comparație</span>\n<h2 class=\"font-headline-lg text-2xl md:text-headline-lg leading-tight mb-4\" id=\"diferente-titlu\">Unde se desparte o petrecere de familie de o nuntă</h2>\n<p class=\"font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant mb-8 md:mb-10 max-w-3xl\">Cele mai multe decizii de la o nuntă au la o petrecere de familie un răspuns mai simplu — sau niciunul. Diferențele care contează:</p>\n<div class=\"flex flex-col border-b border-outline-variant/20\">\n<div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-2 md:gap-8 py-5 md:py-6 border-t border-outline-variant/20\">\n<h3 class=\"font-headline-md text-lg md:text-headline-md text-on-surface leading-snug md:w-1/3 shrink-0\">Programul</h3>\n<p class=\"font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant\">Nu există o ordine știută de toți. Gazda o scrie, iar ea se poate schimba în timpul serii fără să strice nimic.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-2 md:gap-8 py-5 md:py-6 border-t border-outline-variant/20\">\n<h3 class=\"font-headline-md text-lg md:text-headline-md text-on-surface leading-snug md:w-1/3 shrink-0\">Configurația</h3>\n<p class=\"font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant\">Mai mică, potrivită unui salon sau unei terase. O nuntă umple o sală; o aniversare umple de obicei o masă lungă.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-2 md:gap-8 py-5 md:py-6 border-t border-outline-variant/20\">\n<h3 class=\"font-headline-md text-lg md:text-headline-md text-on-surface leading-snug md:w-1/3 shrink-0\">Durata</h3>\n<p class=\"font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant\">Negociabilă. Seara poate fi scurtă și liniștită sau lungă și dansată, iar asta se hotărăște la organizare, nu se moștenește din tipic.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-2 md:gap-8 py-5 md:py-6 border-t border-outline-variant/20\">\n<h3 class=\"font-headline-md text-lg md:text-headline-md text-on-surface leading-snug md:w-1/3 shrink-0\">Locul</h3>\n<p class=\"font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant\">Local, pensiune, curte sau casă. Fiecare are alte condiții de spațiu, de curent și de liniște față de vecini.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-2 md:gap-8 py-5 md:py-6 border-t border-outline-variant/20\">\n<h3 class=\"font-headline-md text-lg md:text-headline-md text-on-surface leading-snug md:w-1/3 shrink-0\">Protagoniștii</h3>\n<p class=\"font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant\">Un sărbătorit, nu doi miri, doi nași și două familii. Momentele de protocol sunt puține, iar repertoriul se construiește pe gusturile unui singur om.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p class=\"mt-8\"><a class=\"font-label-md text-label-md uppercase tracking-widest text-primary hover:text-white transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-2 min-h-[44px]\" href=\"/nunta/\">Cum se organizează o nuntă <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"text-[18px]\" fill=\"currentColor\" height=\"1em\" style=\"vertical-align:-.125em\" viewbox=\"0 -960 960 960\" width=\"1em\"><path d=\"M693.69-457.31H180v-45.38h513.69L448.39-748 480-780l300 300-300 300-31.61-32 245.3-245.31Z\"></path></svg></a></p>\n</div></div>"}, "elements": []}], "isInner": false}, {"id": "even021", "elType": "container", "settings": {"container_type": "flex", "content_width": "boxed", "boxed_width": {"unit": "px", "size": 1072, "sizes": []}, "flex_direction": "column", "flex_gap": {"unit": "px", "size": 0, "column": "0", "row": "0", "isLinked": true}, "background_background": "classic", "backgr